Icons bundled into Lookin (icons/scalable/actions/)

All icons except lookin-utilities-terminal-symbolic.svg are copied
unchanged (renamed with the "lookin-" prefix) from the Adwaita icon theme
by the GNOME Project, https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/adwaita-icon-theme
Copyright (c) GNOME Project and Adwaita icon theme contributors.
License: CC-BY-SA-3.0 or LGPL-3, and CC-BY-SA-4.0 (as distributed by Debian
in /usr/share/doc/adwaita-icon-theme/copyright).

lookin-utilities-terminal-symbolic.svg was drawn for this project in the
Adwaita symbolic style and is released under the same terms.

Rules: icons must be single-colour symbolic SVGs without any "transform"
attribute: icon themes whose symbolic icons use transforms (Adwaita "legacy"
icons, elementary-xfce) were reported invisible with GTK 4.22, while the
current Adwaita icons, which never use transforms, are what GTK is tested
with. `make check` enforces it.
